OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFrequent showers for Shetland
OL,6,Fthrough the day, turning to more
OL,7,Fpersistent rain for Orkney in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Windy with severe gales
OL,9,Fdeveloping for Orkney through the
OL,10,Fafternoon into the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain in the evening, clearing
OL,13,FOrkney by around midnight, and
OL,14,FShetland in the early hours. Severe
OL,15,Fgales for Orkney at first, gradually
OL,16,Feasing. Gales for Shetland for a time.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FBright spells and a few
OL,19,Fshowers in the morning and wind easing
OL,20,Fdown. Strong winds, showery rain
OL,21,Freturn through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
